A||N||0||x-thumpr-x||She passed Emissions. then muffler broke 4 hrs later ! ||||10||
Z||000000||x-thumpr-x||12-27-2001||07:06 PM||||I brought my $50 GT in today for an emission test and it passed with flying colours. All I put in her was a new set of spark plugs and some Ultra 94 octane gas.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>BUT 4 hrs later on the highway, my intermediate pipe broke off my muffler   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>GOFIGURE! I was on my way to pick up a few items when it happened. I must have went to 6 different muffler shops before one was able to fix it. All they did was put a sleeve in the muffler & tack welded, then put the intermediate pipe over the other end and gave a good solid weld all the way around! Nice and quiet again. This is a temp job till it gets a new muffler next year. <P>Car is almost ready for safety now. Need to replace an upper ball joint and rear caliper. Got the caliper off the parts car, cleaned it all up and everything works. Went to take the bleder screw out and SNAP. So, I'm heading downstairs now to fix it with a bleeder screw repair kit for $12 rather then $100 for a new caliper! <p>[This message has been edited by x-thumpr-x (edited 12-27-2001).]||||reg||10
